  "headline": "The 11-pathway translation/proteostasis signature first observed as the driver of mouse-gastrocnemius -> human-i4-skin transfer (PR #8) reproduces across every Inspiration4 PBMC subset, both Twins T-cell contrasts, and the original i4_skin compartment. Within-overlap biology control (the 14 non-proteostasis pathways from the same 25-pathway set) shows a weaker, less uniform suppression pattern, supporting the claim that translation suppression \u2014 not a generic 'everything goes down' effect \u2014 is the conserved cross-tissue spaceflight signal anchored by ribosomal protein genes."
